WEBVTT

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.610
Disgaea

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:56.910
It's like I'm tied up tight
by the sighs of love.

00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:01.980
I can't break free
no matter what spell I try.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:09.700
Tranquil eyes that conceal
sorrow behind them...

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:14.930
...throw my heart into turmoil
more than they ought to.

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:23.480
You mean more to me
than I do,

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:29.710
...even though we both refuse
to admit to our feelings.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:35.880
You're the one for me.
I don't care if you're a demon.

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:42.590
Oh, this is a miracle that
I've stumbled upon.

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:49.100
Even these wounds that never fade,
even this profound karma.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:52.440
Oh, I'll give you
my love.

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:54.940
Time and again,
no matter where you are.

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:03.580
I'll give you my love.

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:23.930
The Sleeping Prince
in the Garbage Dump

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.390
Is anyone home?

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:04.700
Ouch...

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.780
Ew, it smells
in here...

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:14.380
What is this place, a garbage dump?
W-Where's the exit?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.330
This is it, no doubt about it!
It has the Overlord's crest on it!

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:31.800
Finally! At long last
I've found it, Seraph Lamington!

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:35.740
Thank you for
your guidance!

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:42.580
Now, it is finally time for me
to carry out my mission!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.680
I'm gonna give it
everything I've got!

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:47.150
Prinpretty pripannica!

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:50.490
Holy Arrow!

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:05.800
Uh-oh, it looks like I have a ways to go...
In that case!

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.310
Hup!

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:21.920
Okay, then!

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.650
Who goes there?!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:05.160
What suicidal fool dares disturb the sleep
of the mighty Laharl?!

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.110
Oh, dear.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.550
Where the hell
am I?

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:23.580
I think it's some kind
of garbage dump.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:28.020
Garbage?! I could've sworn
I was in the Overlord's Castle...

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:32.720
Hey, wait a minute. Were you
the one who woke me up?

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:36.660
Yes. Um, I'm sorry for disturbing
you while you were resting.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:41.030
I'm Flonne, an assassin dispatched
from Celestia!

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:42.260
What?

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:46.410
Well, like I said, I'm an
assassin named Flonne.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.670
You're an angel?

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.610
Actually, I'm just an
Angel Trainee.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:57.540
A lowly angel in training
thinks she can assassinate me?!

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:03.220
No, that's not quite right!
I had the wrong person!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.580
Er, make that the
wrong demon!

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.080
Come again?

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:10.160
If you don't mind my asking...
Did you just say that your name was Laharl?

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.160
The one and only!
I am the mighty Laharl!

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:16.030
Oh, I knew it!
I had the wrong person!

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:19.500
But that coffin had the crest
of the Overlord on it,

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:23.100
...so I assumed that King Krichevskoy
was sleeping inside.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.970
YOU MORON!

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.980
King Krichevskoy
is my old man!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.120
He's your father?!

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:40.660
So let me get this straight. A flunky like you
came here to assassinate the Overlord?

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:41.730
Right!

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:47.690
<i>Well, he is a weakling, so it's no surprise
that Celestia doesn't think much of him.</i>

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:54.470
Um, to be perfectly honest, I think that
assassination is a terrible thing.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:59.040
But I was told that it was of vital importance
for both the Netherworld and Celestia.

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.910
<i>You are such
a moron.</i>

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.050
Even when you yourself
don't agree with something,

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:06.420
if somebody tells you to do it,
you go, "Sir, yes sir!"?

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.920
So, Celestia's full of
lapdogs like you, huh?

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:17.430
It went out.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:19.730
Are you okay?

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.130
Don't touch me!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.800
What the hell?
I've got no strength...

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.870
You don't seem to
be feeling well.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:31.480
I'll use a restoration spell
to make you feel better!

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.110
Prinpretty Pripannica!

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:37.110
Be restored,
strength of love!

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:41.650
Love, you say?
Love is for losers!

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:46.120
Don't you ever say the word "love"
in front of me!

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:07.870
Hey, this is the ancestral crypt of the Overlords.
What was I doing in a place like this?

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.540
What's going on?

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.760
W-Wait for me!

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.130
That hurt...

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.700
King Krichevskoy has
passed away?!

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:33.770
What?!

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:39.070
Oh, I've seen this castle before! I saw it
when I first came down to the Netherworld!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.040
Gimme!

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:42.140
There was smoke
and fire everywhere.

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:46.750
What's this?! He died
two years ago?!

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:50.210
But he was alive and kicking
right before I lay down for my nap!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:53.550
So I've been asleep
for two years?

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:56.520
I've been searching
for two whole years, too.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.530
I'm a little amazed that you didn't know,
and not in a good way.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:02.630
Darn it, and here I thought that
I'd finally found the castle...

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.900
This isn't the castle!
It's a crypt.

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:08.740
That first castle you saw
was the Overlord's Castle.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.070
You're pretty dense,
aren't you?

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.140
Where are you going?

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:18.410
Back to the castle! This is wrong!
It's all wrong!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.850
It says here, "The great Overlord
met a tragic end..."

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.790
"...when he choked on a
Dumpling of the Damned."

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:37.070
My old man was a fool,
right up to the very end!

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:38.470
That weakling!

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:41.340
You shouldn't laugh!
It's cruel!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:42.500
Excuse me?

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:46.210
I mean, you'll never, ever
see your father again!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:47.910
Yeah, what about it?

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.510
It's so mean!
It's so sad!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:55.190
Should a girl who came here to assassinate
my old man be saying stuff like that?

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.420
This and that are two entirely
different things.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:59.250
Aren't you sad?

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.220
Nope. Not one bit.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.690
That can't be true.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:06.060
When you lose a loved one or something
that's precious to you,

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:07.730
I think you're supposed
to cry!

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.890
I think you're supposed
to be heartbroken!

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:13.200
I don't understand a single
word you're saying.

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:14.330
But why?

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.710
What do you mean, why?!
'Cause I'm a demon, that's why!

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:21.610
Do you mean to say that demons
don't know what it's like to feel sad?

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:24.750
Nope.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:31.480
If that's true, then demons don't know
what it's like to feel love, either?

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:36.620
Sadness is made possible
because of love!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:39.630
Exactly! Demons don't
feel love, either!

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:42.260
But that's...
That's so sad!

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.830
I'll never, ever acknowledge love
as anything but worthless!

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:18.200
You bastard... Do you have
any idea who I am?

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:21.430
You're Laharl, legitimate heir
to King Krichevskoy.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:23.170
I didn't expect you
to wake up.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.570
What?

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:29.940
Violence is never the answer!
Let's talk this out!

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:32.050
Quit butting in with
your mindless yammering!

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:35.250
I doubt you have any strength
left to fight!

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:41.360
Are you all right?

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.060
My body isn't doing
what I tell it do...

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:10.150
Disgaea

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:17.160
Disgaea

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:26.860
What the hell
is that?

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.350
How cool!

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.290
You think so?

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:02.440
The emissary of justice who endlessly fights
the good fight to safeguard peace on Earth!

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:05.170
Who the hell are these
irritating fools?

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:06.570
Don't interrupt!

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:11.380
The rule for the villain is that he hears the
hero out while he makes his entrance speech!

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:14.080
Don't assume that I'm
the villain here!

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:22.320
Captain Gordon, 37th Defender
of Earth, has arrived!

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.600
Earth, huh?

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.100
Amazing! That was
so cool!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:33.440
Thank you, fair maiden! Have no fear,
Captain Gordon is here!

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:41.650
You two aren't hurt,
are you?

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.650
You're safe now, we've taken care
of those two scary demons.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:51.050
We're here to rescue you.
Now, climb aboard our spaceship.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:59.000
What's the matter?

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:02.000
Stay away from me!

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:06.270
Keep that freakishly voluptuous body
away from me!

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:09.130
Laharl, what's the matter?

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:12.740
Oh, I understand now!
You're going through puberty, aren't you?

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:16.750
My body is completely different from
your girlfriend's, so it's no wonder.

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:20.750
Who are you calling my girlfriend,
you insolent wench?

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.510
Laharl, hang in there!

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:28.420
Laharl, your weakness isn't
voluptuous bodies, is it?

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:32.330
Still, it would be terrible if these tremors
developed into something serious.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.420
Thursday,
run a diagnosis.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:38.070
ROGER. NOW SCANNING
IN MEDICAL MODE.

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:48.040
CHECK COMPLETE.
POISON DETECTED IN SUBJECT'S BODY.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:48.910
Poison?

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:50.920
Poison?!
Was it you?!

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:53.550
I would never do such
a cowardly thing!

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:55.990
Wait right here!
I'll get the first aid kit!

00:14:56.260 --> 00:15:00.130
That's all right! I'll cast
an antidote spell!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:01.350
Spell?

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:12.500
What a warm, gentle light...

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:15.370
Miss, what in the world was
that power you just used?

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:18.270
I'm Flonne,
an Angel Trainee.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:20.480
An angel, you say?

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:23.880
Oh, so we saved the life
of an angel!

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:27.310
This is Laharl!
He's a demon prince!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:31.260
You're saying that this boy
is a demon?!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.050
Now I see! We interrupted you
and those monsters...

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.150
...as you were about to attack
this helpless little angel girl!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.430
Don't be stupid!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:44.670
Oh, that's wonderful!
The poison's gone!

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.240
Laharl!

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:53.250
How rude!

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.180
Oh, my!

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.250
Oh!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:04.150
DANGER! DANGER!
SEXUAL HARASSMENT!

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:06.550
That's weird.

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:07.890
What is?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:11.660
Thanks to that flat chest of yours,
I don't feel like barfing anymore.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.690
I'm glad that
I could help!

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:16.030
Hands off the angel,
foul demon!

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:18.460
Angel, come over here!
Hurry!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.400
COME, COME!
HURRY OVER TO US!

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:21.770
Hey, human!

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:23.540
What do you want,
vile fiend?!

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.050
Hey, that hurt!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:32.790
The Netherworld belongs to me!
I won't stand for this invasion!

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:37.250
What invasion? I came here
to vanquish demons!

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:40.750
Jennifer! Thursday!
Begin formation!

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:41.930
Roger!

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:53.870
Now, taste the
fierce attack of justice!

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:55.340
Oh, shut up!

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.820
I'm back!
I'm back in action!

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:17.000
<i>Now that's the power
I'm used to!</i>

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:25.930
What have you done?

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:29.030
Laharl! Violence is
never the answer!

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:32.770
This was just a misunderstanding!
We could have worked it out by talking!

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:35.540
Look, your job is done,
so go back to Celestia.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:40.020
After all, my old man's dead.
All you have to do is take credit for it.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:41.950
It's wrong to lie!

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:47.930
Have it your way, then.
I'm going back to the Overlord's Castle.

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:55.930
It's gone! Gone!
My pendant is missing!

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:58.130
Laharl, have you seen
my pendant?!

00:17:58.340 --> 00:17:59.330
Nope.

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:02.700
I got that pendant from
the Seraph himself...

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:07.070
Without that pendant, an Angel Trainee like me
can't stay in the Netherworld for long!

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.990
I was only able to search for the
Overlord these past two years...

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:15.150
...because I was under
that pendant's protection!

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:20.820
If I can't find it, all my strength will be sapped
away by the Netherworld, and I'll die!

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:23.320
Sounds good to me.

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:27.100
It'll save me the trouble
of killing you myself.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:31.500
But if you really, really need it, I could
help you look for it if the price is right.

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:34.840
Really, you will?!
Then please! Help me look!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:38.970
Oh, dear... What happened to all
the spending money I was given?

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:42.640
If you're gonna ask a demon for a favor,
you better have some money on hand.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:45.710
Wait! Laharl!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:56.320
Curse that demon! He looked like a child,
so I let my guard down! But not next time!

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:59.060
Thursday, where did you
get that pendant?

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:00.830
I FOUND IT.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.800
BEEP BEEP BLIP BEEP.

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:07.500
It's not here...

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.210
Or here! Or here! Or here!
Or here! Or here!

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:12.310
I can't find it!

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:19.140
What am I gonna do?
If I don't find it, I'm gonna disappear...

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:30.530
Would you give it
a rest?!

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:32.200
It wasn't...

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:35.900
Laharl!

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:39.440
I guess you're not the only one
who doesn't know when to quit.

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:57.510
He isn't fighting like
he was before!

00:19:57.620 --> 00:20:00.590
Of course I'm not! You're facing
the real Laharl this time!

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:19.540
Answer me. You were surprised when
you saw me awake, weren't you?

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.270
What do you know?

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:25.380
Were you the one
who poisoned me?

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.290
<i>Answer me,
or you get this.</i>

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:34.330
Wait! I'll talk, so don't! Spare me,
I'll tell you anything you want to know!

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.530
Then start talking!

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:47.800
Moron.

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:51.410
That was terrible, Laharl!
You said that you would spare him!

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:57.410
You try to solve everything
with violence...

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.910
What you do tramples
all over love!

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:04.860
There's that "love" again... I've had it
up to here with that love fixation of yours!

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:10.390
Your way of thinking causes terrible disasters
in both Celestia and the human world.

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:14.300
I might rot away soon.

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:17.830
But I will use every ounce of strength
I have to assassinate you!

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:21.130
I thought you it was my old man
that you wanted to assassinate!

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:24.140
No, I changed my target
just now!

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:26.740
This oughta be good.
Let's do it.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:29.870
I'm sick of you and your stupid
Love Freak crap!

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:33.180
Here goes!
Durian Dragon Dranyago!

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:50.230
Hey! We both know you're no match for me,
but that's no excuse not to fight me yourself!

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:52.800
You call yourself an angel?!
This is cheating!

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:58.270
Okay, dragon! Go get that demon
who denies the value of love!

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:04.210
Whatever! Come get some!

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.160
Ah, there he is!

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:48.620
If people ever notice the cycle of time
on this world where blue skies come and go,

00:22:48.960 --> 00:22:56.660
something's bound to happen when people
with different outlooks get together.

00:22:56.970 --> 00:23:04.810
Will we be buried by our desires?
Will love come and save the day?

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:11.870
Either way, it doesn't matter to me.
I'm gonna do as I please.

00:23:12.550 --> 00:23:20.320
Light and shadow, egoists for whom
everything in the world has meaning,

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:28.130
every little fragment lives his life
with the balance on their shoulders.

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:35.540
Doing whatever we want,
having it exactly the way we want it.

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:39.970
Right now,
under the same sky,

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:44.070
light and shadow
repeat again and again.

00:23:44.990 --> 00:23:49.290
Chain react...

00:23:56.600 --> 00:24:00.530
Hi! Disgaea's all about my previews!
They're more popular than the show itself!

00:24:00.630 --> 00:24:03.500
Believe it or not, in episode 2,
Prince Laharl dies in the line of duty!

00:24:03.600 --> 00:24:05.090
Hey, don't try
to kill me off!

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:07.900
As grief casts a shadow over the Netherworld,
a new heroine appears!

00:24:08.010 --> 00:24:10.530
Rise up, dark beauty
Princess Etna!

00:24:10.640 --> 00:24:12.080
Who made you
a princess?

00:24:12.210 --> 00:24:16.380
Next time on Disgaea!
"Scratch 1 Mid-Boss, Add 1 Vassal"!

00:24:16.780 --> 00:24:19.340
Be won over as the princess
conveys her feelings through song!

00:24:19.450 --> 00:24:20.190
The title's the only thing
that's normal about this preview.

00:24:20.190 --> 00:24:20.920
Next Time:
Scratch 1 Mid-Boss, Add 1 Vassal

00:24:20.920 --> 00:24:22.720
Next Time:
Scratch 1 Mid-Boss, Add 1 Vassal
Well, the adults
have their reasons.

00:24:22.720 --> 00:24:25.090
